# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the test suite.
#
# Pango loads fonts on a background thread and fontconfig keeps its own caches;
# very occasionally (about 1 run in 500) something it allocated there is still
# unreleased when the process exits, even after we release Pango's font map and
# call FcFini(). The allocation stacks are entirely inside libfontconfig, none of
# it memory rei-wm owns, so these are ignored. Leaks allocated by rei-wm are still
# reported.
leak:libfontconfig
